@title 3D view: EMC view of the drive example (classes, keep-clear bands, hot spots, card, legend, light look)
@area 3D
# View > EMC view (or the EMC button in the 3D toolbar): coloured cable classes, keep-clear bands, numbered hot spots and the card.
key ctrl+k
wait 6
text open emc example
wait 8
key Enter
wait 30
click_text 3D #1
wait 30
click_text EMC #1
wait 30
shot emc-overview
check_layout
click_text "mains beside analog" #1
wait 15
shot emc-card
check_layout
click_text "Exposure map" #1
wait 15
shot emc-exposure
check_layout
key ctrl+k
wait 6
text preferences
wait 8
key Enter
wait 10
click_text Light
wait 10
key Escape
wait 15
shot emc-light
check_layout
